// purpose: MCP Server Registered to Entra
// source: https://github.com/jkerai1/KQL-Queries/blob/829b34aea9fce1b50995ff348ee7be6b8eca34f3/Entra/MCP%20Server%20Registered%20to%20Entra.kql
